OL,3,GNEWSAMemorial for pupils contaminated
OL,4,Awith HIV and hepatitis
OL,5,
OL,6,FA memorial has been created at a school
OL,7,Fwhere boys were experimented on and
OL,8,Finfected with HIV and hepatitis.
OL,10,FDuring the 1970s and 1980s, the Lord
OL,11,FMayor Treloar School and College in
OL,12,FHampshire offered specialist care for
OL,13,Fchildren with haemophilia but pupils
OL,14,Freceived medical treatments using
OL,15,Fcontaminated blood products.
OL,17,FOf the 122 pupils with haemophilia that
OL,18,Fattended the school, only about 30 were
OL,19,Fstill alive when the Infected Blood
OL,20,FPublic Inquiry published its report
OL,21,Finto the scandal in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
