OL,3,GNEWSAMemorial for pupils contaminated
OL,4,Awith HIV and hepatitis
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt highlighted how "very few" of the
OL,7,Fpupils with haemophilia that attended
OL,8,Fthe school between 1970 and 1987
OL,9,F"escaped being infected".
